description:
It is like your friend that does all the web3 operations that you ask him to do. With simple text commands, you can effortlessly perform cross-chain transfers, place bets on Polymarket, and much more.

The AI-powered agent is designed to seamlessly interact with dapps, prediction markets, providing an intuitive and automated way for users to manage their assets, place bets, receive notifications, and more. This integration leverages Across Protocol, Polymarket, Uniswap V4, Coinbase CDP, Dynamic, Push Protocol and a range of other protocols to create a comprehensive solution with an emphasis on security user experience.

- The AI agent can execute predefined actions (e.g., placing bets, make cross-chain swaps, deploy smart contracts) based on user inputs or specific triggers;
- Users can move assets effortlessly, cost-effectively and fast inside Ethereum ecosystem between different layers (L1 and L2) using the Across Protocol;
- Users can place bets, and view/manage positions on the Polymarket platform through a human language;
- The AI agent filters and delivers notifications based on user-defined preferences, thanks to Push Protocol;
- Users can enjoy trustless bridging from L1 to L2 on the Scroll devnet, thanks L1SLOAD;
- Agent supports ENS integration to provide human-readable names for blockchain addresses, improving usability and reducing errors;
- Users can deploy Uniswap V4 pools with verified hooks through an intuitive interface that requests constructor parameters and other necessary inputs;
- AI Agents has an ability to buy products via Coinbase CDP Onchain Commerce;
- The product offers a seamless and secure authentication mechanism to log in to integrated  mini-apps;

https://github.com/RostyslavBortman/AIAgent-Backend/tree/develop
https://github.com/RostyslavBortman/AIAgent-MiniApp - World MiniApp
https://github.com/RostyslavBortman/merchant-mock - Merchant mock via Coinbase CDP Onchain Commerce
https://github.com/RostyslavBortman/seamless-bridge - Trustless bridge via scroll devnet l1sload

how_its_made:
- We used Across Protocol to solve liquidity fragmentation across L2s via cross chain swaps, thanks eip-7683; 
- We used Polymarket and it's API for markets search and bets placement;
- We used L1SLOAD opcode on Scroll devnet to create trustless bridge;
- We used ENS to allow users to operate with simple ENS names;
- We used HookRank API for the easy Uniswap V4 Pools deployment;
- We used Coinbase CDP Onchain Commerce to allow our AI Agent to buy some coffe;
- We used Push Protocol to create an effective informational stream from the bussiness owner to customer;
- We used World to create MiniApp with simple and clear UX; 
- We used Open API 4o model to simplify users interaction with web3 world;
